<h4><a href="{{ blogs.testimonials.url }}">Testimonials</a></h4>
{% assign blog = blogs.testimonials %}
{% if blog.articles.size > 0 %}
	{% for article in blog.articles limit: 2 %}
	<div class="testimonial">
		<blockquote>{{ article.content | strip_html | truncatewords: 24 }}</blockquote>
		<div class="post-title ellipsis"><a href="{{ article.url }}">{{ article.title }}</a></div>
	</div>
	{% endfor %}
{% else %}	
	<div class="instructions">
	<p>Instructions for the Testimonials Widget</p>
	<ol>
		<li>Create a blog called Testimonials</li>
		<li>Create an article for each testimonial.</li>
		<li>The title of the article should contain the name of the person making the testimonial:
			<ul>
				<li>You can optionally include a date using:<br/><code>&lt;span class="date">May 18, 2010&lt;/span></code></li>
				<li>You can optionally include a location:<br/><code>&lt;span class="location">Newbury, Porridge&lt;/span></code></li>
				<li>Full example for a title:<br/>Gavin Terrill, <code>&lt;span class="date">May 18, 2010&lt;/span></code>, <code>&lt;span class="location">Hickles, Pickles USA&lt;/span></code></li>
			</ul>
		</li>
		<li>The quote should be in the article content</p>
	</ol>
	</div>
{% endif %}	
